      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MAECENAS.\nWelcome, dear madam.\nEach heart in Rome does love and pity you.\nOnly th’ adulterous Antony, most large\nIn his abominations, turns you off\nAnd gives his potent regiment to a trull\nThat noises it against us.",
